  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline TORO TORO is a super-slick six-sided co-polyester designed to combine massive spin with surgical precision and predictable response. Its hexagonal geometry provides strong mechanical ball grip, while the slick surface supports efficient string movement and snapback. A softer flex increases ball pocketing, dwell time and feel, allowing aggressive players to take full cuts at the ball with greater confidence and reduced fear of overhitting. TORO TORO is available in Neon Pink and Neon Orange, both in 1.23 mm / 17 gauge.",

    "zh": "Toroline TORO TORO 是一款采用六边形结构和 Super-Slick 超光滑表面的高性能共聚酯球线，核心定位是 Massive Spin、Surgical Precision 与 Predictable Response。六边形截面负责提供强机械咬球，而低摩擦表面则帮助球线移动并快速 Snapback。相比更硬的控制型聚酯，TORO TORO 采用更柔和的 Flex，能够增加 Ball Pocketing、Dwell Time 和触球感，让球员在高速完整挥拍时依然保持信心，并降低过度击球出界的风险。产品规格统一为 1.23 毫米 / 17，提供 Neon Pink 与 Neon Orange 两种颜色。"
  },

